# Nightkin Ambusher's CantBlockBy names ValidDefender$ Player.Condition
# Counters.RAD (PlayerProperty.java:484-487): the defending player has rad
# counters, so a Grizzly Bears block is refused and, with none, the Ambusher
# deals 4.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
expecterror 509.1b declareblockers
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
